<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>RimCuisine 2 Core (Continued)</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_Wheat"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: spelt plant -->
            <label>planta de trigo</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_Wheat"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: Spelt is a species of wheat that has been cultivated since approximately 5000 BC. A good source of dietary fiber, protein (which it contains more of than common wheat), and vitamins and minerals. Spelt takes almost an entire growing season to come to fruition. While fragile and time-consuming, this cereal has been genetically engineered to gently break into flour with a mere touch. -->
            <description>Una planta cereal de color ámbar que tarda casi toda una temporada de crecimiento en fructificar. Aunque es frágil y lleva tiempo, este trigo ha sido modificado genéticamente para deshacerse suavemente en harina con un simple toque.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_Flour"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: spelt flour -->
            <label>harina</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_Flour"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: Spelt flour, ideal for use in baking. Spelt flour takes a very long time to go bad, if stored in a dry environment. It was produced by spelt that has been genetically engineered to gently break into flour with a mere touch. -->
            <description>Harina de trigo, usada en horneado. La harina de trigo tarda muchísimo en echarse a perder si se almacena en un ambiente seco. Fue producida por trigo modificado genéticamente para deshacerse suavemente en harina con un simple toque.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_Cheese"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: cow cheese -->
            <label>queso</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingCategoryDef[defName="VCE_Cheese"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: aged cheese -->
            <label>queso</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_AgaveNectar"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: maguey syrup -->
            <label>néctar de agave</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_AgaveNectar"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: A thin and semi-sweet syrup extracted from agave, known for its healing and anti-inflammatory properties. Although healthier than sugar, its high fructose content may be harmful if taken constantly. -->
            <description>Un néctar ligero y semidulce, conocido por sus propiedades curativas y antiinflamatorias. Aunque es más saludable que el azúcar, su alto contenido de fructosa puede ser dañino si se consume constantemente.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/HediffDef[defName="VCE_ConsumedAgave"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: consumed maguey syrup (from meal) -->
            <label>consumió néctar de agave (de una comida)</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/HediffDef[defName="VCE_ConsumedAgave"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: A thin and semi-sweet syrup extracted from agave, known for its healing and anti-inflammatory properties. Gives a 15% immunity gain speed boost for 24 hours. -->
            <description>El néctar de agave es un néctar ligero y semidulce, conocido por sus propiedades curativas y antiinflamatorias. Otorga un aumento del 15% en la velocidad de ganancia de inmunidad durante 12 horas.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_RawSugar"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: brown sugar -->
            <label>azúcar</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_RawSugar"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: Brown sugar is a sucrose sugar product with a distinctive brown color due to the presence of sugarcane molasses, and it adds a much desired sweetness. Sugar is easily converted into energy by the body, which may result in a nice burst of energy. -->
            <description>Azúcar de caña cristalina simple, añade una dulzura muy deseada. El azúcar se convierte fácilmente en energía en el cuerpo, lo que puede resultar en una buena explosión de energía.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/HediffDef[defName="VCE_SugarRush"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: consumed brown sugar (from meal) -->
            <label>subidón de azúcar (de una comida)</label>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>VGP Vegetable Garden</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_Sugarcane"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: uba sugarcane plant -->
            <label>planta de caña de azúcar</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCE_Sugarcane"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: A thick, tall, tropical grass with jointed stems. The Uba variety is much hardier but less productive than common sugarcane. While not exactly the most nutritious thing to eat on its own, this genetically modified sugarcane is easily milled into brown sugar and then used for a variety of culinary creations - Particularly desserts. -->
            <description>Una hierba tropical gruesa y alta con tallos articulados. Aunque no es precisamente lo más nutritivo para comer por sí sola, esta caña de azúcar modificada genéticamente se muele fácilmente para obtener azúcar y luego se usa para una variedad de creaciones culinarias, particularmente postres.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
</Patch>